 "rules": {
  "continuity": "for each control: the 32-update seed-0 run (its frozen treatment) must have the SAME mask sha256 and checkpoint weight sha256 as the earlier record and |held-out difference| <= 1e-3 at every common evaluation step; pass -> earlier 256-update development records (if any) are reused, fail -> rerun",
  "treatment": "per new support: 'energy' iff mean_3(none) - mean_3(energy) > 1e-4 on validation 9_000..9_003 after 256 updates (seeds 0 / 1 / 2, all present exactly once), else 'none'",
  "mixed": "among Cover-Mix32 p1 / p2 with their frozen treatments: the lower mean 256-update validation loss; if the means differ by <= 1e-4, p1",
  "balanced": "Balanced-TopK/16 (quota layout 0) is a required final candidate regardless of development",
  "dx_screen": "per tiling (graph 0, 8 samples per process): median complete step (ms).  Eligible: legal launch, correctness gates passed (dX test file), executed variant = requested, Cover-TopK/16 M 8192 faster than legacy, BP-row/16 M 8192 <= 1.03 x legacy, Cover-TopK/16 M 512 <= 1.03 x legacy.  Finalists: the <= 2 eligible tilings of lowest Cover-TopK/16 M 8192 complete step (dX time is not the criterion)",
  "backend": "graph-mean (graphs 0 / 1 / 2) complete step at M 8192: a finalist qualifies iff Cover-TopK/16 <= 0.95 x legacy, BP-row/16 and the selected Mix32 <= 1.03 x legacy, and Cover-TopK/16 M 512 <= 1.03 x legacy (and every correctness gate passed); the qualifying finalist of largest Cover-TopK/16 gain is chosen; none -> legacy (negative result reported)",
  "continuation": "Cover-TopK/16, Balanced-TopK/16#0, the selected Mix32 and BP-row/16 continue 1000 -> 4000 updates (all three init / SR pairs)",
  "freeze": "treatments, mixed candidate, continuation list and backend are frozen in final_selection.json BEFORE the icdx39000 / icdx89000 tests are opened"
 },
